# Audio Snippet Player – optional env when running with a server (e.g. nuxt dev or node .output/server/index.mjs)
#
# Proxy: GET /api/proxy?url=<encoded-url> streams the remote resource for direct audio when CORS blocks playback.
# No env vars required for the proxy; it is available whenever the Nitro server runs.
#
# Example (for future Redis short links):
# REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
